Data notice
-----------
Analysis inputs redistribute publicly released provincial statistics from:
- CECODES / VFF-CRT / RTA / UNDP (PAPI)
- Ministry of Science and Technology / former MIC (DTI)
- National Statistics Office of Viet Nam (population, urban share, GRDP)
- Resolution 202/2025/QH15 (merger map)
- geoBoundaries (gbOpen) for historical ADM1 geometry

Reuse of those datasets remains subject to their original terms and attribution
requirements. The MIT license above covers the analysis code and derived
tables/figures produced by this package.
